  "raw_text": "The `disown` command was added after launching the terminal process so that closing or exiting the parent shell would not kill the child capture session. Without `disown`, the launched `mate-terminal` process would be part of the calling shell's process group and would receive a hangup signal on parent exit, potentially terminating the capture before the session completes and before gzip runs.",
